  "adaptations": [
    "Static module bindings replace only fixed global/UMD loading and the __esModule descriptor. The complete called synchronous graph and all PublicKey/PrivateKey methods remain.",
    "Unused async prime/key generation, Worker/source-string generation and sham digest/HMAC/Buffer dependencies are omitted; none belongs to this registered synchronous workload.",
    "Types, overload signatures and declare fields erase; all original key-class assignments and ordering remain. Four extended-GCD temporary annotations resolve circular inference without runtime changes.",
    "The exact driver generator uses local currentSeed and resetRandom. Its six integer-mixing steps and unsigned division are unchanged. Reset runs before every original iteration, matching driver preIterationCode.",
    "The shim remains an object literal with its original own getRandomValues method. Local random() replaces Math.random. The potentially undefined temporary uses ?? 0 at its original bitwise conversion, preserving undefined-to-zero semantics.",
    "After original decryption checks, serialize 13 actual key/ciphertext/plaintext fields to complete decimal strings and mix their full code units and lengths. The latest bounded observation is retained; every complete iteration contributes.",
    "One original Benchmark instance lives outside work, and its original final validate runs after requested iterations. No key size, primality rounds, input, allocation inside key generation or original validation is reduced."
  ],
